(403, 'Children Doctor Dentist 2', '225102bed76847d99248bfe52a2fc17d', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/225102bed76847d99248bfe52a2fc17d/', 'assets/thumbs/225102bed76847d99248bfe52a2fc17d.jpg', 'In our new exciting game, you will manage a real dental hospital. And every day you will have to see many patients - funny animals. All of them have the only problem - their teeth hurt. And all of them need to accept and provide medical care. And actually you have such a unique opportunity. Using modern medical tools, you can help your little patients.', 'Care', 6, 'publish', '2026-04-19 09:27:35'),
(404, 'Baby Taylor Goes Sick', '7549532a2d7444ea82462d4bc0730cfb', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/7549532a2d7444ea82462d4bc0730cfb/', 'assets/thumbs/7549532a2d7444ea82462d4bc0730cfb.jpg', 'It’s a cold day. But Taylor wants to wear a new beautiful dress. Unluckily she has a fever in the next day. Her mom calls up a doctor to have a look. The doctor gives some medicine and advices for Taylor to make sure she will be cured in a few days. It\'s really tough time for Taylor. She needs you at this moment. Be with her and offer her care and love till she gets well soon. Have fun!', 'Care', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 09:27:37'),
