(408, 'Racing Game King HP', 'd132f5f8eab94506828f58ef0c5b1e29', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/d132f5f8eab94506828f58ef0c5b1e29/', 'assets/thumbs/d132f5f8eab94506828f58ef0c5b1e29.jpg', 'Racing Game King is a racing game with a many game modes. So here comes the &quot;Circuit race&quot; against few rivals, where there is nothing more important than being first at finish line. Then a &quot;Sprint race&quot;, a race from point A to point B. &quot;Time-attack&quot; - you vs. time, quite decent challenge. We also have a &quot;Knockout race&quot; here, where you should try to take place between the last two drivers. The  &quot;Speed trap&quot;, where you have to pass certain points on the track at the highest speed possible.', 'Sports', 7, 'publish', '2026-04-19 09:28:35'),
