(416, 'Restaurant Simulator: Burgers &amp; Pizza', '990eb0343915410bbb1a0210f99cac3c', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/990eb0343915410bbb1a0210f99cac3c/', 'assets/thumbs/990eb0343915410bbb1a0210f99cac3c.jpg', '&quot;Restaurant Simulator: Burgers &amp; Pizza&quot; is an exciting cooking and business management game where you become the owner of a fast food establishment. Prepare delicious burgers, tasty pizza, and other dishes while building a restaurant empire!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nReal-time cooking - fulfill orders, combine ingredients\r\nVaried menu - burgers, pizza, fries, drinks &amp; desserts\r\nBusiness growth - open new locations, hire staff\r\nEconomic strategy - manage finances, increase profits', 'Cooking', 4, 'publish', '2026-04-19 09:30:06'),
