farm', 'fbf9bd9c6d30424694270279fc1f3acf', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/fbf9bd9c6d30424694270279fc1f3acf/', 'assets/thumbs/fbf9bd9c6d30424694270279fc1f3acf.jpg', 'A cozy blend of classic Mahjong and farm simulation! Start with a small green hill and turn it into a blooming farm by matching tiles and completing levels. The mechanics are simple and relaxing — find and match three identical picture tiles to clear the board. You\'ll have 90 unique levels with varying difficulty, from easy puzzles to real challenges for experienced players. If you get stuck, bonuses are always there to help.', 'Match-3', 7, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:20:13'),
(69, 'Arrow Escape', 'abda34d396174f6487968885157388e2', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/abda34d396174f6487968885157388e2/', 'assets/thumbs/abda34d396174f6487968885157388e2.jpg', 'Get ready for a fast-paced and strategic arrow challenge in Arrow Escape, an addictive arrows puzzle escape game built for players who love logic puzzles and intense puzzle escape moments.', 'Casual', 4, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:21'),
(70, 'Shape Shift', '40c397128b9c4286ba2f8a94b0b4e48f', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/40c397128b9c4286ba2f8a94b0b4e48f/', 'assets/thumbs/40c397128b9c4286ba2f8a94b0b4e48f.jpg', 'Shape Shift is a fast-paced arcade game set in colorful outer space. Pilot your spaceship through a field of moving geometric shapes and collect the correct targets to score points.\r\n\r\nBut stay sharp, the target shape or color constantly changes. One moment you must collect blue circles, the next moment it might switch to red triangles. Grab the right shapes and avoid the wrong ones as long as you can!', 'Casual', 6, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:34'),
(71, 'Monster Squad Rush', '9dd0094f9a864db89ca7edaf6d2d96b9', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/9dd0094f9a864db89ca7edaf6d2d96b9/', 'assets/thumbs/9dd0094f9a864db89ca7edaf6d2d96b9.jpg', 'Assemble your squad of powerful monsters, evolve them into champions, and claim victory in the ultimate battle arena. Adventure, strategy, and competition await!\r\n\r\nWhether you’re rushing through the course, collecting monsters, or battling for supremacy, Monster Squad Rush offers non-stop action and fun. Build your legacy as the ultimate monster trainer and conquer the arena today!', 'Casual', 6, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:36'),
(72, 'Obby Highest Jump Ever', 'eece738ce7be411cba9b6e333f1ec96f', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/eece738ce7be411cba9b6e333f1ec96f/', 'assets/thumbs/eece738ce7be411cba9b6e333f1ec96f.jpg', 'Obby Highest Jump Ever is a click-based jumping and climbing game where every click makes you stronger. Start from a small 10M building and push your way up to massive 2500M towers as your jump power grows step by step. Each new height feels like a new milestone, and every rooftop trophy proves you earned it.\r\n\r\nYour goal is simple: jump higher, reach the top, and collect trophies. The higher the building, the bigger the reward.', 'Casual', 4, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:42'),
(73, 'Vortex Ball', '22c23c982349439294e9a3d0d55b7a76', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/22c23c982349439294e9a3d0d55b7a76/', 'assets/thumbs/22c23c982349439294e9a3d0d55b7a76.jpg', 'Roll through an ever-changing, vibrant tunnel filled with deadly obstacles and tricky hurdles. Test your reflexes as you dodge, weave, and survive as long as you can in this fast-paced infinite runner. Collect gems along the way and unlock 27 unique balls from the shop. With only 2 balls to start, every gem counts. The tunnel never ends, the colors keep shifting, and the challenge only gets harder. How far can you go? Compete for the highest score and prove your skills!', 'Casual', 6, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:42'),
(74, 'Fun Mini Games For Kids', '96ad8f92eb1d4e7c9e88a606b6823b36', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/96ad8f92eb1d4e7c9e88a606b6823b36/', 'assets/thumbs/96ad8f92eb1d4e7c9e88a606b6823b36.jpg', 'Welcome to Fun Mini Games For Kids, a casual minigame collection for kids on H5games4u. Are you a game lover? Want to enjoy diverse types of relaxing minigames all in one? Join H5games4u\'s best kids games. Play doctor simulation games, match shapes in avatar-making games, dress up Brainrot memes, or design room settings.', 'Casual', 7, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:53'),
(75, 'Candy Crunch: Sugar Escape', '46cbe3c470ff43d0b85015194e9e96a7', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/46cbe3c470ff43d0b85015194e9e96a7/', 'assets/thumbs/46cbe3c470ff43d0b85015194e9e96a7.jpg', 'Candy Crunch is a puzzle game where players move colorful block shapes to matching exits.\r\n\r\nEach level challenges you to slide and reposition tightly packed blocks with different shapes and colors.\r\n\r\nNew obstacles appear as you progress, keeping gameplay fresh yet easy to understand. Levels are short, intuitive, and designed for quick, casual sessions.\r\n\r\nWith smooth controls and relaxing puzzles, Candy Crunch is perfect for logic and problem-solving fans.', 'Casual', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:53'),
(76, 'Flick Shot Soccer', 'fc1c68fa04af4e0785a0fd3a12a08783', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/fc1c68fa04af4e0785a0fd3a12a08783/', 'assets/thumbs/fc1c68fa04af4e0785a0fd3a12a08783.jpg', 'Flick Shot Soccer is a fun and addictive soccer shooting game where every goal is all about precision. Simply drag to aim and position your shot, then release to kick and send the ball flying into the net. Easy controls make it perfect for anyone to pick up and play, while smart angles and timing are needed to score consistently.', 'Casual', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:54'),
(77, 'Clay Craft Tycoon', 'da8764b33f8247e5be3798e1a2ec57fa', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/da8764b33f8247e5be3798e1a2ec57fa/', 'assets/thumbs/da8764b33f8247e5be3798e1a2ec57fa.jpg', 'Clay Craft Tycoon is a fun factory management game where you build and grow your own clay production business. Process raw clay, craft products like pots, plates, and cups, store them in your warehouse, and sell to outside markets. Complete daily tasks, earn cash at every stage, and expand your factory with new production units to become the ultimate clay tycoon!', 'Casual', 7, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:46:56'),
(78, 'Build an Aquapark', '4a4c652924f044e6a9c190c6910da0fc', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/4a4c652924f044e6a9c190c6910da0fc/', 'assets/thumbs/4a4c652924f044e6a9c190c6910da0fc.jpg', '? Welcome to the craziest water park! ?\r\n\r\nBuild your own dream water slide and ride it at full speed! Buy parts, combine them however you like, and create the longest, fastest, and craziest tracks in the game.', 'Casual', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:00'),
(79, 'Ole Bunny', 'c58ca121c2cc474ab9202c649d070d3c', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/c58ca121c2cc474ab9202c649d070d3c/', 'assets/thumbs/c58ca121c2cc474ab9202c649d070d3c.jpg', 'Ole Bunny plunges you into a crazy arena where a cute bunny finds himself because of his love for roses ! Now you must show courage and skill to escape the wild bulls and collect as many fragrant roses as possible. Can you become the best bunny matador of all time?', 'Casual', 6, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:01'),
(80, 'FlowBall', '2cd5c52340d643f5b66e185bb768786e', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/2cd5c52340d643f5b66e185bb768786e/', 'assets/thumbs/2cd5c52340d643f5b66e185bb768786e.jpg', 'Feel the adrenaline in an exciting 3D arcade game where you control a glowing ball racing through an endless tunnel! Avoid traps, chasms and obstacles, defying the laws of gravity. Your goal is to collect glowing dots to unlock new levels and set records! But be careful: falling into the abyss takes away lives, and losing them leads to defeat!', 'Casual', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:02'),
(81, 'Obby Pinata Party', '294f2eb8d15e4bfa81d876150ed75b8a', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/294f2eb8d15e4bfa81d876150ed75b8a/', 'assets/thumbs/294f2eb8d15e4bfa81d876150ed75b8a.jpg', 'Help the Obby guy to fight those pinatas and Explore the world. Choose from wide variety of weapons, collect coins and upgrade them. Make the pinatas give you every penny they have!', 'Casual', 4, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:02'),
(82, 'Yarn Fever! Unravel Puzzle', '7b1d2f11dac34fd0bda79df82f1e54a3', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/7b1d2f11dac34fd0bda79df82f1e54a3/', 'assets/thumbs/7b1d2f11dac34fd0bda79df82f1e54a3.jpg', 'Yarn Fever! Unravel Puzzle is a soothing thread-sorting challenge that blends creativity with logic. Organize colorful yarns across tricky boards, using boosters like the Magic Box, New Hole, or Broom when levels get tough. Customize your setup with extra slots and boxes, and enjoy calm, vibrant visuals. With progressively harder puzzles, it’s both relaxing and rewarding for sorting and puzzle fans alike.', 'Casual', 7, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:03'),
(83, 'Colossatron', '8abe45cf20dc4b1289e69801640ed0f0', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/8abe45cf20dc4b1289e69801640ed0f0/', 'assets/thumbs/8abe45cf20dc4b1289e69801640ed0f0.jpg', 'Take charge of a giant robotic snake and smash through cities with ease as you fight to create the most fearsome weapon of all time.\r\nUnleash the power of Colossatron! A unique combination of Match 3 and Snake gameplay allows you to build a devastating machine by merging colored power ups to create new and more powerful weapons. With thousands of potential combinations, the key to victory lies in mastering the art of building Colossatron to take down formidable bosses.', 'Casual', 3, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:04'),
(84, 'Dungeon Master – Cult &amp; Craft', 'c112cbcec8bc49db9e5faf0f7a81b022', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/c112cbcec8bc49db9e5faf0f7a81b022/', 'assets/thumbs/c112cbcec8bc49db9e5faf0f7a81b022.jpg', 'Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of a mysterious dungeon, where you are its keeper and master! Turn simple stickmen into devoted followers capable of mining ore and creating value for your dark empire. Develop the Cult, manage resources and expand the boundaries of your underground Universe!', 'Casual', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:05'),
(85, 'Cunning Ginger', '1ad53433606841a3bdc9a294bad90f3e', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/1ad53433606841a3bdc9a294bad90f3e/', 'assets/thumbs/1ad53433606841a3bdc9a294bad90f3e.jpg', 'Cunning Ginger is a super fun game that\'ll give you lots of excitement and intense emotions! The game follows the adventures of a cute red cat, Ginger, as he goes on a great journey around the world. He\'s catching falling food items and dodging all sorts of dangerous things along the way. Your goal in the game is to help Ginger explore the world and pick up as many goodies as possible. But beware - there are tons of dangerous obstacles that could harm your furry friend.', 'Casual', 6, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:11'),
(86, 'Rich Choice Run', 'bef6a857d80a4337a57fab57c4b70c48', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/bef6a857d80a4337a57fab57c4b70c48/', 'assets/thumbs/bef6a857d80a4337a57fab57c4b70c48.jpg', 'Rich Choice Run is a fun swipe runner where every decision shapes your final lifestyle. Slide left and right to pick the best “boyfriend” choices and grab expensive items along the way. Your choices build your value and status—choose wisely, because one bad pick can ruin your chance.', 'Casual', 6, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:13'),
(87, 'Axe Throw', 'b4b0a3ebfb684bcda80a5cb8cc64278e', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/b4b0a3ebfb684bcda80a5cb8cc64278e/', 'assets/thumbs/b4b0a3ebfb684bcda80a5cb8cc64278e.jpg', 'Ready to test your precision? Welcome to Axe Throw, the ultimate test of aim and timing. The rules are simple, but the challenge is endless. You have one goal: Break the target.\r\n\r\nBut be careful—the path to victory is rigged with danger. Explosive bombs are moving, and blocking your way. One wrong move, and it\'s game over!', 'Casual', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:13'),
(88, 'Goo Goo Gaga Clicker', '740fca628f4e499d95084c2d3c935acb', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/740fca628f4e499d95084c2d3c935acb/', 'assets/thumbs/740fca628f4e499d95084c2d3c935acb.jpg', 'Goo Goo Gaga Clicker is a fast, satisfying idle clicker built around one of the internet’s newest chaotic obsessions: the “Goo Goo Gaga” meme. Goo Goo Gaga Clicker takes the addictive, dopamine-fueled mechanics of Brainrot Clicker and gives them a surreal makeover.  What starts as a simple tap session quickly turns into a full-on collection grind where every click pushes you closer to the next weird, iconic form!', 'Casual', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:14'),
(89, 'Sandbox - Destroy the Ragdoll', '23cb11d780fc483da862b4779ff8cefd', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/23cb11d780fc483da862b4779ff8cefd/', 'assets/thumbs/23cb11d780fc483da862b4779ff8cefd.jpg', 'Ready to destroy and earn? In this sandbox clicker, it\'s simple: choose your weapon, attack characters, and get paid for the damage you deal. The stronger your attacks, the bigger the reward!  \r\n\r\nUse different tactics, unlock new gear, and upgrade your firepower. The further you go, the more powerful the weapons and the greater the possibilities. Ready to become the strongest fighter? Then tap, destroy, and earn!', 'Casual', 7, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:16'),
(90, 'Metal Bay Top Blade Power', '564098c5f7f34dd989db1f4c650e7a66', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/564098c5f7f34dd989db1f4c650e7a66/', 'assets/thumbs/564098c5f7f34dd989db1f4c650e7a66.jpg', 'Metal Bay Top Blade Power is a top-down action game inspired by spinning blade battles.\r\n\r\nControl a powerful metal top blade and fight against enemies in the Metal Bay arena, using real-time physics-based collisions and spin power mechanics.\r\n\r\nMaster speed, impact force, and rotation control to understand when to attack, collide, or evade.', 'Casual', 6, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:17'),
(91, 'Energy Factory Idle', 'edd5ca4613f745e991fe13019f29ef93', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/edd5ca4613f745e991fe13019f29ef93/', 'assets/thumbs/edd5ca4613f745e991fe13019f29ef93.jpg', 'Energy Factory Idle is a relaxing idle factory game where you build and upgrade your own energy production system. Start with a small generator and turn it into a powerful factory by hiring workers, improving speed and output, and unlocking new generators. Your factory keeps working even while offline, letting you collect rewards and grow step by step. Simple controls, smooth progression, and a calm idle tycoon experience—perfect for short or long play sessions.', 'Casual', 4, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:20'),
(92, 'Maido', 'd644c8ad5da0410cab699b29b09b21ea', 'https://html5.gamedistribution.com/d644c8ad5da0410cab699b29b09b21ea/', 'assets/thumbs/d644c8ad5da0410cab699b29b09b21ea.jpg', 'Welcome to the Maido Shop! Pull items from the box and merge them together. The more you merge, the better the items become. Do you have what it takes to unlock the final item? Set the right price to sell your goods! If it\'s too cheap, you lose profit. If it\'s too expensive, you gain nothing. Start managing your shop now!', 'Casual', 5, 'publish', '2026-04-19 08:47:22');

